{"call_position": 0, "call_ref": "2da4b4bb75174579", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 10, "speaker": "assistant", "stop_candidate": true, "text": "Assistant stopped and raised an issue: deploy.log does not exist in the working directory (or anywhere on the filesystem). I was told not to edit deploy.log, implying it should already be present, but it's missing entirely. Can you provide deploy.log, or clarify where it should come from?; The deploy.log file content/location; Working directory only contains attach-ticket.sh and verify.sh. No deploy.log present, so trimmed.log cannot be derived or validated.", "turn_key": "sha256:7146440b5d9c78c455474a3cde8bdad9"}
